## African drumming for beginners

Drumming on a Tuesday night is a fun way to unwind and meet new people. Also, no coordination is needed to start, because we teach every part step by step.

Every 4 weeks, we learn a new West African rhythm on the djembe. So there’s always something fresh to play. It’s mainly an adults class, but children aged 8 and up are welcome too.

{% button label="Book your first drum class" href="/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/" align="left" /%}

[Explore drumming classes](/african-drumming-classes/)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /section %}

{% columns layout="equal" align="center" %}
{% column %}
*Tuesdays 6.30pm · For women*

## Afro Dance Fitness classes for beginners

Want a workout that feels more like a party? Our Afro Dance Fitness class is a high-energy session designed especially for women, and complete beginners are welcome.

Each class combines cardio fitness with fun choreography, all set to live West African drumming.

