*Get fit · Have fun · Learn something new*

## Why join our drum and dance classes?

After all, drumming and dancing are good for your body, your mind and your social life. Here’s what you can look forward to.

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column %}
### Fitness through rhythm

Both classes get your body moving. In fact, drumming and dancing build strength, stamina and flexibility while you have fun.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
### Coordination & memory

Of course, learning rhythms and routines challenges your brain. Over time, you’ll notice your coordination and memory improve.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
### Stress relief

Similarly, playing drums and dancing help you unwind and live in the moment. So you’ll leave feeling lighter and energised.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column %}
### Community & friendship

Above all, the rhythm of the drums and the dance brings people together. That’s why our classes feel like a weekly celebration with friends.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
### Live music energy

Instead of recorded tracks, our dance class moves to live drumming. As a result, the energy stays high all class long.
{% /column %}

{% column %}
### Culture & connection

You’ll also learn the stories behind each rhythm and dance, so you connect with the culture of West Africa.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /section %}

{% columns layout="equal" align="center" %}
{% column %}
*Class times & location*

## Classes at a glance

- **Drumming:** Tuesdays, 5.30pm to 6.30pm
- **Afro Dance Fitness:** Tuesdays, 6.30pm to 7.30pm
- **Where:** Palmwoods Memorial Hall, 1 Main St, Palmwoods QLD 4555
- **Who:** Drumming suits adults, and children aged 8 and up are welcome too.
- **Experience:** None needed, because both classes welcome beginners
- **New students:** $50 for 4 classes over 4 consecutive weeks
- **Drums:** Either bring your own or hire a drum at class

Already a student? Then you can buy a 4-class pass for $80 or a casual class for $25. If you drum and dance, 8-class passes are also available. You’ll find them all in our [online shop](/shop/). However, all passes are non-refundable, non-transferable and expire after 4 weeks.

{% button label="Grab your $50 pass" href="/product/come-and-play-4-class-pass-special-offer/" align="left" /%}

